-- Promotion batch
-- Topic: jsx (language: en x5, tr x5)
--
-- Generated by .claude/skills/quiz-questions/build_quiz.py from a hand-authored spec:
-- 5 concept pairs, each an EN and an independently written TR question on the
-- same concept, grounded in content/en/jsx.md and content/tr/jsx.md. Not produced
